Debug mode highlights each of the three declarators of a plain `const`, the first from `const` and the others by their bare names, never their values.
== args
--debug
input/const-triple.ts
== file input/const-triple.ts
const x = 1, y = 2, z = 3;
== stdout
«const x» = 1, «y» = 2, «z» = 3;
== stderr
== exit 0
